h":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2p.1/chat.md","size_bytes":2779},"commits":{"digest":"7a10b926f422b551f8e10ce312a0f8591bff842ee69f59ea83e7f555b738e999","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2p.1/commits.json","size_bytes":233},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2p.1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"90d58e6d306aab267a4add5042ae3db2970f8feef1d3b90106818fa1c8ae61cd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2p.1/meta.json","size_bytes":5996},"prompt":{"digest":"0e2ce4feeb423138a65e3d8c33cd461293d0e5b95650a6b1ace35b7fdf7da2e6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2p.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":184},"state":{"digest":"d2919119bfc14cc44d197545a8d69b4031e75c78097f5d2988415944710d20d3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2p.1/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2p.1","local_name":"bob-cli-2p.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-2p","agent_clan_generation":"20260929191812","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-2p.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-2p[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Named Pomodoro starts with `=<X>#pomodoro` in `bob capture` and Bob[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A whole capture item `=<X>#<pomodoro>` (for example `=#deep-work`, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`=3#bugs`, `=-2#bugs`) starts the named Pomodoro now with `se<X>` [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]timing, atomically. It starts the open placeholder whose name [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]matches (whole slug, else prefix), or a new session named like a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]completed match, or a brand-new named session. The token composes [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]in same-line chains (`=x =#bugs` switches sessions in one line). [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`bob capture-parse` and `bob capture-complete` expose it, and Bob [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Mac Capture completes the name with a start-aware list, highlights [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]it, previews the session live, and teaches the syntax.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]named_pomodoro_start.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/named_pomodoro_start.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-2p[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-2p/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]`=<X>#pomodoro` grammar, chains, and named session start in [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]`bob capture`[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]execution[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]execution: extend the shared `=`-family lexer with an optional `#name` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]part, claim `=<X>#name` (and the `=x#name` near miss) as whole-item [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]session tokens and chain tokens, plan the named start (resolve, guard, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]start or create, move to the current slot, report queued links), and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]update JSON, human output, and `bob capture --help`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Named starts in `bob capture-parse`[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]editor[dim] · [dim][/dim]after execution[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]editor: mirror the named start in the live-editor parser. Report mode, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`section`, spans, the `=<X>#` incomplete state, and every near-miss [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]diagnostic with precise ranges. Keep `@@` away from named starts and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]extend the editor/execution parity tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]`pomodoro_start_name` completion context in `bob [/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]capture-complete`[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]completion[dim] · [dim][/dim]after editor[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion: add the `pomodoro_start_name` context for the name part of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`=<X>#name`, and return start-aware candidates from today's ledger: [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]planned placeholders with `next_up`, a create row, \"again\" rows for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completed sessions, nameable rows, and the running entry last. Include [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]help, human output, and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Capture docs and README for named starts[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after execution, editor, completion[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: document `=<X>#pomodoro` in `docs/capture.md` (grammar tables, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lifecycle, a new \"Starting a named Pomodoro\" section, chains, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-parse, and capture-complete) and in `README.md`, all consistent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with the shipped behavior.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture support for named starts[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after execution, editor, completion[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: add the `pomodoro_start_name` completion rows (planned, next up, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]new, again, name it, running) with accept announcements. Add a calm [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]incomplete state for `=#`, a New badge and a `#name` teaching hint on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the start card, and real-bob fixtures, tests, and README. Verify with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]green macOS CI run.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-2p","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-2p.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-65b7e0a516e935fb5978ed147c1881ca","started_at":"2026-09-29T23:20:04.938622+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1790727351,"sha":"f41ab0550a1fe9f4ed988a3186e6d5c454f01e00","subject":"feat(capture): add pomodoro_start_name completion context for =<X>#name"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"137608e3966a109f553b87df7b504789b6f8327df0140bd34ef789fa01841098","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2p.3/chat.md","size_bytes":5442},"commits":{"digest":"3731abfa7dd31253a8d9f9b79e87166396dd74674de089f40d0885a4608fe8eb","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2p.3/commits.json","size_bytes":249},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2p.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"6ad74e5f2a09895c48cf61080ba425fbd560a22b6bfbc18671680e7440f7ab2e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2p.3/meta.json","size_bytes":718},"prompt":{"digest":"22a2dfb508ae831aac7e34403b54942b0a014d4d39d1361c4edd151910227a92","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2p.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":159},"state":{"digest":"51b2c427ee8cb